        <mxCell id="boundary" value="Unknown codes or conflicting evidence need review. Keep known facts and the last successful status when an attempt fails.&#10;A timeout keeps the external result unknown. Check the original report before unsafe replay or cancellation replacement.&#10;Public and private reports can both apply. Incoming already-reported evidence does not automatically create another report." style="text;html=0;align=left;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
